        "TileImage": "$($repository 51cfc04c-3fd1-41f9-b3f2-d9bf2e6b72d7).Image",
        "Description": "We got an assignment from our American friends at MIT 47. Your main targets are museum owner Hailey Brennan and restorer Jean-Luc Salois. The US got a lead that the two are planning to sell several priceless artifacts at a secret auction. The US believes that they are also connected to the &quot;Lost Ark&quot; which is sought by the Russians for unknown reasons. You must also eliminate the two mercenaries who are part of the operation and then dig around in the basement of the building for clues.",
